{
    "title": "Lanetalk",
    "description": "LaneTalk is the ultimate bowling app that automatically tracks your scores and delivers stats and insights straight to your phone. Trusted by nearly 400,000 bowlers, including pros like Jason Belmonte, Kyle Troup, and Verity Crawley, LaneTalk helps you improve your game effortlessly.\r\n\r\nFree Features:\r\n\r\nAutomatic or Manual Score Tracking: \r\nScores and stats sync directly from over 1,500 connected centers, or you can manually add scores from non-connected centers.\r\n\r\nFor All Skill Levels: \r\nWhether you\u2019re a beginner or seasoned bowler, LaneTalk offers insights to help you improve.\r\n\r\nGame-Changing Insights: \r\nAs the official stats supplier for PBA and USBC, LaneTalk helps you track and improve your game with insights used by top bowlers. With data from over 700 million games, LaneTalk is your trusted partner in elevating your performance. \r\n\r\nReal-Time Live Scoring: \r\nFollow live action from your center or any connected bowling event in real-time.\r\n\r\nChallenge Anytime, Anywhere: \r\nCompete in online tournaments or friendly challenges with bowlers worldwide and climb the leaderboards.\r\n\r\nTry LaneTalk PRO - Free for 1 Month:\r\n\r\nUnlimited Game Stats: \r\nAccess detailed insights across unlimited games for more advanced analysis. \r\n\r\nAdvanced Metrics: \r\nTrack all pin leaves and explore detailed stats to get deeper insights into your performance.\r\n\r\nCompare Anything: \r\nTag your bowling balls, oil patterns, and leagues to see how your game varies under different conditions.\r\n\r\nStack up Against the Pros: \r\nCompare your stats with friends or even professional bowlers to see how you rank.\r\n\r\nYour Path to Improvement: \r\nGet a breakdown of key stats to focus on, helping you reach the next average tier.\r\n\r\nAd-Free Live Scoring:  \r\nEnjoy live scoring without the ads - focused on the game, distraction-free.\r\n\r\nJoin the 400,000-Strong Community\r\nDownload LaneTalk today and start improving your game with automatic score tracking, live updates, and powerful stats. It\u2019s free for both bowlers and centers to join and become part of the LaneTalk community.",
    "descriptionHTML": "LaneTalk is the ultimate bowling app that automatically tracks your scores and delivers stats and insights straight to your phone. Trusted by nearly 400,000 bowlers, including pros like Jason Belmonte, Kyle Troup, and Verity Crawley, LaneTalk helps you improve your game effortlessly.<br><br>Free Features:<br><br>Automatic or Manual Score Tracking: <br>Scores and stats sync directly from over 1,500 connected centers, or you can manually add scores from non-connected centers.<br><br>For All Skill Levels: <br>Whether you\u2019re a beginner or seasoned bowler, LaneTalk offers insights to help you improve.<br><br>Game-Changing Insights: <br>As the official stats supplier for PBA and USBC, LaneTalk helps you track and improve your game with insights used by top bowlers. With data from over 700 million games, LaneTalk is your trusted partner in elevating your performance. <br><br>Real-Time Live Scoring: <br>Follow live action from your center or any connected bowling event in real-time.<br><br>Challenge Anytime, Anywhere: <br>Compete in online tournaments or friendly challenges with bowlers worldwide and climb the leaderboards.<br><br>Try LaneTalk PRO - Free for 1 Month:<br><br>Unlimited Game Stats: <br>Access detailed insights across unlimited games for more advanced analysis. <br><br>Advanced Metrics: <br>Track all pin leaves and explore detailed stats to get deeper insights into your performance.<br><br>Compare Anything: <br>Tag your bowling balls, oil patterns, and leagues to see how your game varies under different conditions.<br><br>Stack up Against the Pros: <br>Compare your stats with friends or even professional bowlers to see how you rank.<br><br>Your Path to Improvement: <br>Get a breakdown of key stats to focus on, helping you reach the next average tier.<br><br>Ad-Free Live Scoring:  <br>Enjoy live scoring without the ads - focused on the game, distraction-free.<br><br>Join the 400,000-Strong Community<br>Download LaneTalk today and sta